<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Tabacal posts $31.7 mln loss in 9 mths.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Tabacal posts $31.7 mln loss in 9 mths.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended Sept 30 Net loss $31.7 million vs n/a Note: The company said it posted an extraordinary loss of $10.0 million. Net assets were $134.3 million. No comparatives or quarterly figures given. Full name is Ingenio y Refineria San Martin del Tabacal SA.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 3180668</p>
